OL,3,AIsrael marks three years since
OL,4,AHamas-led 7 October 2023 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraelis are marking three years since
OL,7,Fthe Hamas-led attack on 7 October 2023,
OL,8,Fin which about 1,200 people were killed
OL,9,Fand 251 others were taken hostage
OL,11,FMemorial events are taking place across
OL,12,FIsrael - they began with a nationwide
OL,13,Fminute's silence at 06:29 local time
OL,14,F(04:29 BST), to mark the time the
OL,15,Fattacks started
OL,17,FAt the site of the Nova music festival,
OL,18,Fwhere 378 people were killed and 44
OL,19,Ftaken hostage, the mother of one victim
OL,20,Fsays the attacks were "dystopic,
OL,21,Funimaginable"
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
