OL,3,AIsrael marks three years since
OL,4,AHamas-led 7 October 2023 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"What happened here was not human,"
OL,7,Fsays Ahuva Yavin Mayze, whose daughter
OL,8,Fwas shot dead at the festival
OL,10,FIn response to the 7 October attacks,
OL,11,FIsrael launched a military offensive in
OL,12,FGaza in which more than 74,200 people
OL,13,Fhave been killed, according to the
OL,14,FHamas-run health ministry
OL,16,FIsrael does not allow international
OL,17,Fnews organisations, including the BBC,
OL,18,Finto Gaza to report freely
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
